  "_create_comment": [
    "validate_create: the CREATE-only rule, added 2026-09-15 after task 0.11b.",
    "",
    "A real agent ingest wrote 22 events all carrying the generic default source,",
    "so none took a derived id and re-running the document would have duplicated",
    "all 22. The rule requiring a source was already written into the",
    "calendar-write skill and deployed; it was not followed. So it moves from an",
    "instruction into the gate.",
    "",
    "CREATE ONLY. The source is half the natural key and the key is derived at",
    "insert. An update addresses an existing row by id, so requiring it there",
    "would refuse legitimate repairs of rows written before any of this existed.",
    "",
    "Every case here must ALSO satisfy plain validate: these vectors test the",
    "extra rule, not a replacement for the base one."
  ],
